    <h1>The Temporal Bulge: Gravity as Pressure</h1>
    <p class="lead">Standard General Relativity models gravity as a depression in spacetime. The Temporal Decoupling framework proposes an alternative interpretation with identical weak-field mathematics: massive objects create an outward bulge into the Timeless Sea.</p>

